  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "火金蛄來食茶"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b>作者：蔡天享</b></div>\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br /></span></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJMin_ArUHDkSeEUNOJNaJrQWgAZub0WtevBazXiapIp8lkScTTkC01w5NVaFn5YnkPEHN6vwgwQPlLvxN4frp9cnRLAmuu4I1n6e_RuIBkrnlEZNoxNqB28i2_w_3jM9XHtLV-SuM0hAY/s1600/20190419%25E7%2581%25AB%25E9%2587%2591%25E8%259B%2584%25E4%25BE%2586%25E9%25A3%259F%25E8%258C%25B6%25E6%25BC%2594%25E8%25AC%259B%25E8%2580%2585%25E6%25A5%258A%25E5%25B9%25B3%25E4%25B8%2596.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1045\" data-original-width=\"1567\" height=\"425\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJMin_ArUHDkSeEUNOJNaJrQWgAZub0WtevBazXiapIp8lkScTTkC01w5NVaFn5YnkPEHN6vwgwQPlLvxN4frp9cnRLAmuu4I1n6e_RuIBkrnlEZNoxNqB28i2_w_3jM9XHtLV-SuM0hAY/s640/20190419%25E7%2581%25AB%25E9%2587%2591%25E8%259B%2584%25E4%25BE%2586%25E9%25A3%259F%25E8%258C%25B6%25E6%25BC%2594%25E8%25AC%259B%25E8%2580%2585%25E6%25A5%258A%25E5%25B9%25B3%25E4%25B8%2596.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b><br /></b>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n「火金蛄，來食茶，茶燒燒，配弓蕉，茶冷冷，配龍眼，龍眼ē開花，匏仔換冬瓜，冬瓜好煮湯，匏仔換粗糠，粗糠好起火，九嬸婆--ā gâu炊粿，炊kah臭火ta兼to̍h火！」台大昆蟲學系楊平世名譽教授起頭就先教tsit條唸謠，在場ê囡仔大細tuè-leh唸kah喙笑目笑，也歡喜，也學著tuì日本時代百年來，有關台灣火金蛄研究ê歷史、生活環境、發光kap保育ê智識。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n日人時代注重ê研究是火金蛄有佗幾種，二次世界大戰了後到1990年，無啥新ê科學發現，suà--落-去三十冬到tann，台灣本土學者拍拚有相當ê進展。台灣火金蛄攏總有63種，一生大概有四个階段：卵（十日）、幼蟲（十月日）、塗豆仁（七日）hām火金蛄（十五日）。公--ê kap母ê火金蛄配種了後，母ê火金蛄kā卵放tī澹溼ê塗岸仔--裡，孵做幼蟲，愛食螺仔kap杜蚓，suà--落變塗豆仁，tsiânn禮拜後就變做閃閃sih-sih ê火金蛄--ah！</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n土地開發致使都市罕得看著火金蛄，真濟有志拍拚做生態水池beh kā復育，挖窟仔、做塗岸、放清氣水、種花草、放螺仔、煞尾tsiah囥火金蛄幼蟲入--去，hōo in有thang食koh有閘遮歇睏ê所在，bē去hōo蝦仔、南洋tāi仔(吳郭魚)iah是田嬰ê幼蟲（『水蠆』）食--去，thìng好生湠，庄跤種作ê田園mā ài有仝款ê觀念kap做法。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n近來tsit一二十冬，逐家新興tī清明過了，sio招去遊賞火金蛄，有ê去就近ê公園，有ê趁歇睏日去庄跤，蹛民宿，享受火金蛄閃sih恬靜ê暗暝，親像天星bih落來草埔仔hit一樣，大人囡仔lóng歡喜。比論講台北木柵公園ê萃湖kap虎山ê虎山溪、台中東勢林場iah是嘉義阿里山，lóng是出名走揣火金蛄ê好所在。火金蛄結合生態遊覽，連帶提昇在地農產品買賣hām文化交流，有影是「一兼二顧，摸蜊兼洗褲。」</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n雖bóng bē少專家kap民眾有teh注重保育火金蛄，m̄-koh iáu是拄著bē少問題，特別是田岸hām溝仔khōng紅毛塗kap作穡人thāu農藥，所引起ê棲息地破壞，若beh kā火金蛄生湠ê環境顧hōo好，就bē-sái得汙染水質、ài做塗岸、種本土花草，推廣生態遊覽mā ài控制人額，mài siunn kā攪擾，全面來配合，tsiah有永續ê火金蛄生態，lán ê囝囝孫孫tsiah ē-tàng ná看火金蛄飛來手--裡ná唱「火金蛄，來食茶，茶燒燒…」。</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiXM8M8zeHJbIaPNIj88bNSJF8pSiu9BHIjSCW0gDUBNeVepNR7KChXdrRr0rkk9cvlTi-qmQot1GNoYGedpZB23V9neX0BFUjIe2w6BB_PqGl94j8lmIdBfxTvsPrz-eA04zih3Lrwwu3O/s1600/20190419%25E7%2581%25AB%25E9%2587%2591%25E8%259B%2584%25E4%25BE%2586%25E9%25A3%259F%25E8%258C%25B6%25E8%25AC%259B%25E5%25BA%25A7%25E8%2581%25BD%25E7%259C%25BEkap%25E6%25BC%2594%25E8%25AC%259B%25E8%2580%2585%25E5%2590%2588%25E5%25BD%25B1.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1108\" data-original-width=\"1477\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiXM8M8zeHJbIaPNIj88bNSJF8pSiu9BHIjSCW0gDUBNeVepNR7KChXdrRr0rkk9cvlTi-qmQot1GNoYGedpZB23V9neX0BFUjIe2w6BB_PqGl94j8lmIdBfxTvsPrz-eA04zih3Lrwwu3O/s640/20190419%25E7%2581%25AB%25E9%2587%2591%25E8%259B%2584%25E4%25BE%2586%25E9%25A3%259F%25E8%258C%25B6%25E8%25AC%259B%25E5%25BA%25A7%25E8%2581%25BD%25E7%259C%25BEkap%25E6%25BC%2594%25E8%25AC%259B%25E8%2580%2585%25E5%2590%2588%25E5%25BD%25B1.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgGctHADGvMctv-Xy_Ls7drHeBHKf5lAw2u-kClxhyrGDZiAL-s8xdlLekFxm3JDZdW0uf6B9LN26yhSCoTLCYB3AqrW7_Xe6HhN9YyCc3VGUINsnSeClFYkgL9O3mciv4Jm1b3RySGUEki/s1600/20190419%25E7%2581%25AB%25E9%2587%2591%25E8%259B%2584%25E4%25BE%2586%25E9%25A3%259F%25E8%258C%25B6%25E8%25AC%259B%25E5%25BA%25A7%25E8%2581%25BD%25E7%259C%25BE%25E7%259B%25B8%25E7%2589%2587.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1045\" data-original-width=\"1567\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgGctHADGvMctv-Xy_Ls7drHeBHKf5lAw2u-kClxhyrGDZiAL-s8xdlLekFxm3JDZdW0uf6B9LN26yhSCoTLCYB3AqrW7_Xe6HhN9YyCc3VGUINsnSeClFYkgL9O3mciv4Jm1b3RySGUEki/s640/20190419%25E7%2581%25AB%25E9%2587%2591%25E8%259B%2584%25E4%25BE%2586%25E9%25A3%259F%25E8%258C%25B6%25E8%25AC%259B%25E5%25BA%25A7%25E8%2581%25BD%25E7%259C%25BE%25E7%259B%25B8%25E7%2589%2587.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">編按：本文是4/19「棲地復育台語講座~火金蛄來食茶」講座摘要記錄。台灣蠻野心足生態協會舉辦ê「蠻野講堂」tuì 2019年3月份起kap李江却台語文教基金會合辦規劃十場有關生態環境議題ê台語講座，歡迎逐家tī逐個月第三禮拜五暗時七點到九點，同齊來「呷米共食廚房」（台北市中正區衡陽路9號3樓）擴展家己ê台語棲地（tshe-tē）！詳細資料ē-tàng看「台灣蠻野心足生態協會」FB專頁。</span></div>\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n</span>\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>棲地復育台語講座專欄，</b></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報302期，2019年5月出刊。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n--------------------------------------------<br />\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">有固定的長期捐款， 讓更多的台語文相關計畫可以穩定的推行，感謝逐家。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
